Tom and Jerry: The Movie is a animation, comedy,
family film directed by Phil Roman.

3
00:10:22,500 --> 00:10:28,500
The popular cartoon cat and mouse are thrown into a feature film.

4
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:56,000
The story has the twosome trying to help an orphan girl who is
being berated and exploited by a greedy guardian.

5
