Doctor Applecheek (voice), played by Henry Gibson.

11
00:38:02,500 --> 00:38:08,500
Tom and Jerry: The Movie is a 1992 American animated musical comedy film based on the
characters Tom and Jerry created by William Hanna and Joseph Barbera.

12
00:41:30,000 --> 00:41:36,000
It was produced and directed by Phil Roman, with a screenplay written by Dennis Marks, who
also scripted some episodes of the then-airing TV series Tom & Jerry Kids.

13
00:44:57,500 --> 00:45:03,500
It features original songs written by Henry Mancini and Leslie
Bricusse and a score also composed by Mancini.

14
00:48:25,000 --> 00:48:31,000
The film stars the voices of Richard Kind, Dana Hill, Anndi McAfee, Tony Jay,
Rip Taylor, Henry Gibson, Michael Bell, Ed Gilbert, David L.

15
00:51:52,500 --> 00:51:58,500
Lander, Howard Morris, and Charlotte Rae.

16
00:55:20,000 --> 00:55:26,000
It is the very first theatrical feature-length animated film featuring the titular characters, as
well as the first piece of theatrically released Tom and Jerry media in 25 years.

17
00:58:47,500 --> 00:58:53,500
Although largely mute in the original cartoons, Tom and Jerry are given
extensive spoken dialogue for the only time to date.

18
01:02:15,000 --> 01:02:21,000
Joseph Barbera, co-founder of Hanna-Barbera Productions and co-creator of the original
Tom and Jerry short films, served as the film's creative consultant.

19
01:05:42,500 --> 01:05:48,500
The film tells the story about an eight-year-old girl named Robyn Starling, who enlists Tom and Jerry's help
to escape from her evil legal guardian and reunite with her lost and presumed-dead father.

20
01:09:10,000 --> 01:09:16,000
Following its premiere in Germany on October 1, 1992, Tom and Jerry: The Movie was released theatrically in the United
States on July 30, 1993, by Miramax Films, which was a subsidiary of The Walt Disney Company at the time.

21
01:12:37,500 --> 01:12:43,500
The film grossed $3.6 million and received negative reviews.

22
01:16:05,000 --> 01:16:11,000
The film explores themes of villain, cartoon cat,
family, cartoon mouse, female villain.

23
01:19:32,500 --> 01:19:38,500
The tone is lighthearted.
